(Instrument Calibration Report Ч Confidential Draft) Tj T*
(Page 1 of 4) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.1 Calibration Procedure) Tj T*
(The spectrometer was calibrated against a reference lamp before each session.) Tj T*
(Calibration coefficients are stored alongside the raw readings, never inside them.) Tj T*
(A drifted calibration is detected by comparing the reference lamp response to its) Tj T*
(recorded baseline, and a drift above two percent triggers a full recalibration.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
