(Instrument Calibration Report Ч Confidential Draft) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.2 Sampling Strategy) Tj T*
(Samples were drawn every ninety seconds over a six hour acquisition window.) Tj T*
(The sampler discards the first reading of each window as a settling artefact.) Tj T*
(Drift correction is applied before the samples are averaged, not afterwards.) Tj T*
(Averaging first would fold the drift into every mean and hide the correction.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
