(6.3 Reproducibility Statement) Tj T*
(Every figure in this report was produced by the pipeline committed alongside it.) Tj T*
(No number in this report was transcribed by hand from a previous version.) Tj T*
(The deterministic profile requires no network access and no downloaded weights.) Tj T*
(The same input therefore yields the same output on any machine that runs the code.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
